WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:04.860
SCHOOL FESTIVAL REPS
BOYS:
GIRLS:

00:01.870 --> 00:05.690
I feel so bad for the girls! 
Talk about rotten luck.

00:04.860 --> 00:05.690
SCHOOL FESTIVAL REPS
BOYS: MAEHARA MAKI
GIRLS:

00:05.690 --> 00:08.200
Whoever wins has to babysit Maehara.

00:08.200 --> 00:10.280
Please... Please no.

00:11.670 --> 00:13.540
All right! I struck out!

00:14.740 --> 00:17.060
Yay, struck out!

00:17.060 --> 00:18.670
Yes! Safe!

00:27.550 --> 00:31.590
Do you all hate Maehara-kun or something?

00:31.920 --> 00:34.110
Why are you acting like this?

00:34.110 --> 00:38.560
Why do you have to shun 
and exclude him so much?

00:38.560 --> 00:41.050
He hasn't done anything wrong.

00:41.050 --> 00:43.070
So tell me why!

00:44.350 --> 00:47.700
Sensei, can I volunteer for the position?

00:47.700 --> 00:48.320
Huh?

00:48.750 --> 00:52.020
I'd like to work with Maehara-kun.

00:52.020 --> 00:53.410
I mean...

00:53.410 --> 00:56.880
I'd prefer to pick someone 
who actually wants to do it, too.

00:57.370 --> 01:00.040
Are you okay with that, Maehara-kun?

01:00.040 --> 01:03.110
If Amami-san says so, 
 I have no complaints.

01:03.110 --> 01:04.380
Wait, Sensei.

01:04.710 --> 01:06.750
I won.

01:09.130 --> 01:09.990
What?

02:42.190 --> 02:44.310
But Asanagi-san...

02:44.310 --> 02:48.770
Whoever draws the winning lot gets 
the job. That's how it works, right?

02:48.770 --> 02:52.020
I have the time, so I'll do it.

02:52.020 --> 02:54.280
But I said I'd do it—

02:54.540 --> 02:55.400
Owwie.

02:55.650 --> 02:58.710
You need to calm down, Yuu.

02:58.710 --> 03:02.960
I get that the way they were treating 
Maehara-kun ticked you off.

03:04.120 --> 03:06.370
But you took it a little too far.

03:06.370 --> 03:07.830
Just take a look around.

03:09.540 --> 03:12.670
Oh, s-sorry, Umi. I...

03:12.670 --> 03:16.260
Come on. I'm not the one 
you need to apologize to.

03:17.260 --> 03:21.250
Sorry for acting out like that, everyone.

03:22.310 --> 03:25.310
Maehara-kun, I'm sorry for 
putting you on the spot, too.

03:25.630 --> 03:28.270
Oh, I'm not bothered by it at all.

03:29.730 --> 03:31.780
Anyway, as per the results of the lottery,

03:31.780 --> 03:36.530
our class reps for the festival will be 
Maehara Maki and me, Asanagi Umi.

03:36.870 --> 03:39.440
We look forward to your support, guys.

03:39.990 --> 03:43.450
A/V ROOM

03:40.490 --> 03:43.450
Man, you're amazing, Asanagi.

03:43.450 --> 03:47.260
Aren't I? Feel free to praise me more.

03:47.920 --> 03:50.260
Okay, now you're getting carried away.

03:50.260 --> 03:53.630
Though I guess I have to 
hand it to you this time.

03:54.340 --> 03:58.560
Yuu's the one who's actually 
amazing, though.

03:59.460 --> 04:04.450
She went at them straight up, 
not caring about ruining the vibes.

04:04.450 --> 04:08.280
It's so cool that she can get angry 
on somebody's behalf like that.

04:08.770 --> 04:14.530
I mean, it must've felt good 
when she yelled at the class, right?

04:16.060 --> 04:16.990
Meanwhile,

04:17.470 --> 04:20.320
I prioritize positive vibes over all else,

04:20.320 --> 04:21.980
so I could never do something like that.

04:23.420 --> 04:25.660
Is everybody here?

04:28.450 --> 04:30.820
I'm Seki, the student council president.

04:30.820 --> 04:32.260
Let's get right down to business.

04:32.260 --> 04:35.960
This is the first meeting of this year's 
school festival executive committee.

04:36.270 --> 04:39.490
Why did Asanagi sound a little down?

04:39.490 --> 04:43.330
I guess homeroom did turn 
into a mess over me.

04:43.800 --> 04:46.760
I gotta do this and show everyone!

04:48.550 --> 04:49.560
Umi!

04:49.560 --> 04:52.100
You waited for us? You didn't have to.

04:52.100 --> 04:54.320
No, but...

04:54.600 --> 04:57.540
Thanks for today. Thanks so much.

04:57.860 --> 05:00.240
You waited for me just to say that?

05:00.240 --> 05:01.030
Yeah.

05:01.030 --> 05:04.030
If you hadn't stopped me, I...

05:04.320 --> 05:06.610
I would've said much nastier things.

05:06.610 --> 05:08.040
I figured.

05:09.330 --> 05:11.160
Thank you, actually.

05:11.520 --> 05:12.620
Huh?

05:12.930 --> 05:14.340
Why?

05:14.410 --> 05:15.500
WINNER

05:18.350 --> 05:21.880
Who wants to see infighting when 
we're supposed to work as a team?

05:21.880 --> 05:24.040
I know, right?

05:26.280 --> 05:29.020
You were my knight 
in shining armor back there.

05:33.650 --> 05:36.400
It's been ages since 
you've called me that.

05:37.610 --> 05:40.070
DECOR

05:38.350 --> 05:40.070
There you have it.

05:40.070 --> 05:42.900
Our class has been put 
in charge of the decor.

05:42.900 --> 05:44.820
What?

05:44.820 --> 05:45.900
Stop that.

05:45.900 --> 05:49.280
Quit complaining just because 
we couldn't do a maid café.

05:49.710 --> 05:53.600
If you can be proactive and 
come up with decor ideas,

05:53.600 --> 05:56.880
some cosplay on the day might not be 
out of the realm of possibility.

05:56.880 --> 05:59.930
Whoa!

05:59.930 --> 06:01.380
For Yuu and Nina, that is.

06:01.380 --> 06:02.670
Wha?!

06:02.670 --> 06:05.970
Why just Ninacchi and me? What about you?

06:05.970 --> 06:07.850
I'm the producer this time.

06:07.850 --> 06:13.440
It's imperative that we exploit you two 
to secure #1 on the popularity ranking.

06:13.860 --> 06:15.360
Isn't that right, Maehara-kun?

06:15.910 --> 06:17.660
Don't ask me.

06:17.660 --> 06:21.150
So, anybody got any decor ideas?

06:27.920 --> 06:29.280
Um...

06:29.280 --> 06:31.100
I do have an idea.

06:31.510 --> 06:34.240
Go for it, Maehara-kun.

06:38.820 --> 06:40.840
Mosaic art using cans, huh?

06:40.840 --> 06:44.300
DECOR
EMPTY CAN MOSAIC ART

06:41.100 --> 06:44.300
Nice going, Maehara. 
You actually thought this out.

06:44.590 --> 06:46.500
Th-That wore me out.

06:46.500 --> 06:49.180
What? That was only the first discussion.

06:49.180 --> 06:52.270
I'm so glad I'm working with you.

06:52.950 --> 06:58.730
If this were Amami-san or someone else, 
my nerves would've given out midway.

06:59.030 --> 07:03.690
Right? You should be 
thanking my lucky stars...

07:03.690 --> 07:06.280
is what I'd like to say...

07:07.010 --> 07:08.660
Here, a gift for you.

07:09.870 --> 07:12.740
That's the lot I drew the other day.

07:14.580 --> 07:18.630
Sorry. I actually didn't win.

07:18.630 --> 07:22.370
What? You came up with that idea 
in the middle of that disaster?

07:22.870 --> 07:24.760
You're really amazing.

07:24.760 --> 07:28.940
Aren't you gonna tell me off? 
I cheated, you know?

07:28.940 --> 07:33.180
If you'd cheated people out of 
something they wanted, sure.

07:34.220 --> 07:36.190
WINNER

07:35.320 --> 07:36.190
So...

07:36.710 --> 07:39.850
I'm glad you drew the winner.

07:39.850 --> 07:41.110
I see.

07:42.980 --> 07:44.860
Thanks, Maehara.

07:51.720 --> 07:54.240
Color Sorting Minister Amami here!

07:54.240 --> 07:57.960
Red ones go there! 
And yellow ones over here!

07:58.700 --> 08:01.880
Ugh, I'm not happy with this.

08:02.180 --> 08:04.860
I ended up just copying the original.

08:04.860 --> 08:06.340
This is plenty impressive.

08:06.340 --> 08:12.510
So we paint this in, pixelate it, 
and decide on a color scheme.

08:12.510 --> 08:15.660
After that, we'll just have to punch holes
 in tons of cans and connect them.

08:15.660 --> 08:17.430
Umi!

08:17.430 --> 08:19.480
What's the matter, Color Sorting Minister?

08:19.480 --> 08:21.160
Reporting in!

08:21.160 --> 08:24.190
We have too many dirty cans with 
stuff like cigarette butts in them!

08:24.190 --> 08:27.650
Let's put those aside and wash them later.

08:27.650 --> 08:30.730
We should probably wash out 
the sugary drink cans, too.

08:31.360 --> 08:32.820
Oh, hey, a manga.

08:33.170 --> 08:37.240
Hey, can I try drawing this?

08:42.590 --> 08:43.630
Done!

08:43.980 --> 08:48.240
What do you think? 
I just drew a pose I came up with.

08:48.630 --> 08:52.890
Amami-san... are you actually 
a pro illustrator in secret?

08:52.890 --> 08:58.350
Oh, please! But I'm glad I drew something 
I'm happy with. It's been a while.

08:58.920 --> 09:00.160
Asanagi-san?

09:00.590 --> 09:04.750
I-If she's this good, 
we should leave the art to Yuu.

09:05.870 --> 09:09.330
Are you sure? But who'll be 
the Color Sorting Minister?

09:09.330 --> 09:11.280
We can have Nina take over.

09:11.280 --> 09:13.240
Roger that!

09:13.640 --> 09:16.750
Umi, Maki-kun! Let's do this!

09:16.750 --> 09:17.450
Sure.

09:47.050 --> 09:48.650
Whoa, this is crazy good!

09:49.130 --> 09:51.280
Yuu drew that.

09:51.280 --> 09:52.530
Seriously?

09:52.530 --> 09:54.740
She really can do it all.

09:55.110 --> 09:56.520
Other than study.

10:00.350 --> 10:04.420
Thanks for cleaning up that mess 
during homeroom, Asanagi-chan.

10:05.650 --> 10:10.140
We were too mean to Maehara-kun. 
We got carried away.

10:10.140 --> 10:12.650
Of course Yuu-chan would get angry.

10:12.650 --> 10:15.640
If you hadn't stopped it there, 
we might've...

10:17.150 --> 10:21.850
Maehara's working his butt off, 
so help him out, okay?

10:21.850 --> 10:23.240
Yep.

10:23.240 --> 10:24.400
See ya.

10:30.860 --> 10:32.110
GOOD WORK, ASANAGI

10:32.110 --> 10:33.610
PRAISE ME MORE

10:33.610 --> 10:35.110
ATTAGIRL

10:35.110 --> 10:37.820
DON'T FEEL PRESSURED TO COME OVER ON
FRIDAY. YOU CAN GO HOME AND REST UP.

10:47.800 --> 10:50.380
This feels like a rarity these days.

11:06.190 --> 11:07.770
Oh, for the love of...

11:08.860 --> 11:10.650
KARAOKE CAN

11:13.940 --> 11:16.040
What is it? What's up?

11:16.040 --> 11:18.870
Oh, sorry, are you out?

11:18.870 --> 11:23.490
I just felt like it wouldn't be right 
to make adjustments on my own.

11:23.490 --> 11:25.280
Okay, and?

11:25.970 --> 11:30.160
And, uh... if you feel like it...

11:30.160 --> 11:31.020
Uh-huh?

11:33.340 --> 11:39.850
Wanna come over for some food and games 
while we go over the design?

11:39.850 --> 11:41.480
Or something?

11:41.480 --> 11:45.900
I see. So you're lonely without me around.

11:45.900 --> 11:47.920
That's not what I'm saying.

11:47.920 --> 11:51.250
Don't lie to me. I see right through you.

11:51.250 --> 11:53.440
Come on, just spit it out.

11:53.860 --> 11:59.160
"I, Maehara Maki, am currently 
missing Asanagi Umi to death!"

11:59.160 --> 12:03.240
W-Wrong! 
Fine, I'll just do this by myself!

12:03.540 --> 12:04.280
Bye!

12:04.280 --> 12:05.670
Wait, wait.

12:06.930 --> 12:09.470
On second thought, can I come over?

12:10.460 --> 12:13.460
I kind of miss you, too.

12:15.050 --> 12:17.340
Umi? Is something the matter?

12:17.340 --> 12:20.140
Sorry, something came up at home.

12:20.550 --> 12:21.970
I'm gonna head out.

12:22.310 --> 12:24.420
O-Okay.

12:28.610 --> 12:29.560
Heya.

12:29.560 --> 12:31.760
Heya. Come on in.

12:32.890 --> 12:34.320
Hey, Maehara.

12:34.740 --> 12:35.780
What?

12:36.150 --> 12:38.530
Just felt like saying it.

12:38.530 --> 12:39.990
What the heck?

12:42.700 --> 12:45.360
Hey, you've made a lot of progress.

12:45.840 --> 12:48.290
I'm really sorry for summoning you 
out of the blue.

12:55.460 --> 12:57.430
Can I lie down for a bit?

12:57.430 --> 13:00.400
Sure. You can take a nap if you want, too.

13:01.150 --> 13:03.890
You want me to take a nap? Here?

13:04.230 --> 13:07.500
Someone's being quite daring.

13:07.500 --> 13:09.310
Hey, you slept just fine the other day!

13:09.750 --> 13:10.830
I guess it's okay.

13:10.830 --> 13:16.270
Masaki-san's given me permission to 
kick your ass if you try anything funny.

13:17.840 --> 13:20.240
Sheesh, that mother of mine.

13:27.050 --> 13:28.430
Hey, Maehara.

13:28.990 --> 13:29.960
What?

13:34.560 --> 13:37.210
You see, I think I...

13:39.310 --> 13:40.180
Huh?!

13:44.360 --> 13:45.840
Amami-san?

13:45.840 --> 13:49.560
Good evening, Maki-kun. 
Sorry for showing up so late.

13:50.480 --> 13:52.660
Umi? I know you're there.

13:58.440 --> 14:00.130
Come in first.

14:01.470 --> 14:04.650
It's okay. I won't stay long.

14:05.120 --> 14:08.330
I don't want to intrude 
on your alone time.

14:08.330 --> 14:11.100
Listen, Yuu. I wasn't trying to...

14:11.100 --> 14:12.040
Amami-san.

14:12.040 --> 14:14.660
When did you figure us out?

14:15.000 --> 14:21.970
She'd been making a lot of excuses lately,
and she seemed oddly comfortable here.

14:22.260 --> 14:27.470
Umi, why didn't you tell me 
you were hanging out with Maki-kun?

14:27.470 --> 14:29.180
Well...

14:29.180 --> 14:30.930
Sorry, it's my fault.

14:31.400 --> 14:34.260
I asked her to keep it a secret.

14:34.260 --> 14:35.400
Umi.

14:35.710 --> 14:37.860
Is that true?

14:38.350 --> 14:43.270
Why won't you say anything? 
Do you not trust me?

14:43.270 --> 14:46.420
Am I the only one who thinks of us 
as best friends?

14:46.420 --> 14:48.580
Do you not see me as that?

14:48.580 --> 14:49.580
That's not it!

14:49.580 --> 14:51.040
Then why?

14:51.040 --> 14:52.450
I...

14:52.830 --> 14:54.500
Umi!

14:56.260 --> 14:58.710
I'm so glad we're in the same class again!

14:58.710 --> 15:01.940
She's so pretty. 
Like a model or something.

15:01.940 --> 15:04.720
You could brag about being friends 
with someone like that.

15:05.060 --> 15:07.890
Oh, are you free next weekend?

15:08.880 --> 15:11.880
Oh, sorry. I have plans.

15:12.590 --> 15:13.430
Me, too.

15:13.430 --> 15:15.330
Sorry, Umi-chan.

15:15.700 --> 15:17.270
All good.

15:18.780 --> 15:21.280
Over here, Yuu-chan!

15:23.110 --> 15:26.330
Sorry! Did you wait long?

15:26.330 --> 15:28.030
Took you long enough.

15:30.580 --> 15:32.540
That's the one thing I can't tell you.

15:32.830 --> 15:34.080
I don't want to.

15:34.490 --> 15:37.620
Maehara, sorry I got you mixed up in this.

15:39.270 --> 15:41.670
I'll be heading out now.

15:41.670 --> 15:43.620
Wait, Umi! I'll go with you!

15:43.620 --> 15:45.320
Please let me go by myself.

15:47.020 --> 15:50.180
Sorry, Yuu. I'm such a jerk.

15:53.890 --> 15:55.810
What do I do, Maki-kun?

15:56.310 --> 15:58.310
I've never seen Umi like that.

16:01.060 --> 16:04.520
< ASANAGI

16:01.060 --> 16:03.070
AMAMI-SAN LEFT

HELLO?

16:03.070 --> 16:04.530
HELLO?

ASANAGI?

16:04.530 --> 16:06.810
She read them, but she didn't respond.

16:06.810 --> 16:09.110
She's not going to skip school, right?

16:09.990 --> 16:11.140
Morning.

16:11.910 --> 16:13.650
Morning, Maki-kun.

16:13.650 --> 16:17.120
Morning, Amami-san.
 And Asanagi-san, too.

16:17.120 --> 16:18.750
Hey.

16:19.790 --> 16:21.480
She seems the same as usual.

16:23.550 --> 16:25.840
TODAY
MAKI-KUN, SORRY ABOUT THIS

16:24.340 --> 16:25.840
Amami-san?

16:29.260 --> 16:35.760
Um, so it's about Umi. 
Have you talked to her since?

16:35.760 --> 16:39.140
No, I haven't. How about you?

16:39.140 --> 16:41.190
Me neither, actually.

16:41.190 --> 16:44.110
I felt too awkward to reach out to her.

16:44.540 --> 16:49.060
But she came to pick me up on Monday 
morning like nothing happened,

16:49.060 --> 16:52.910
so I thought maybe you'd 
smoothed things over with her.

16:52.910 --> 16:55.040
Did she say anything?

16:55.040 --> 16:58.300
"Sorry about Friday. Forget about it."

16:58.300 --> 16:59.560
That's it.

17:01.190 --> 17:05.920
I had my hands full just keeping Asanagi 
and my secret under wraps.

17:06.450 --> 17:08.580
That's the one thing I can't tell you.

17:08.580 --> 17:10.010
I don't want to.

17:10.010 --> 17:14.260
What if Asanagi had to deal with 
all that and a secret of her own?

17:14.780 --> 17:17.220
What if she had to bear 
that burden all by herself?

17:17.510 --> 17:19.990
Ninacchi, no problems with squad B?

17:19.990 --> 17:23.060
Hmm, I think we're a bit short on reds.

17:23.370 --> 17:25.920
Should we get everybody 
together to drink Core Cola?

17:27.120 --> 17:28.960
A... Asanagi-san.

17:30.100 --> 17:31.340
Do you have a sec?

17:31.340 --> 17:32.200
What is it?

17:33.350 --> 17:37.410
I've got something 
important to say to you.

17:39.120 --> 17:43.020
Uh, I need to stay here 
to give out instructions.

17:43.020 --> 17:46.460
We'll be fine. We're checking 
the design as we work.

17:46.460 --> 17:48.630
You can go, Umi.

17:50.150 --> 17:53.840
Squad B will be fine 
without you reps around, too.

17:54.120 --> 17:56.300
Come with me, Asanagi.

17:58.940 --> 18:01.230
You idiot! You stupid idiot!

18:01.230 --> 18:04.110
It's supposed to be a secret 
that we're friends!

18:04.110 --> 18:07.800
But you tied my hands 
by asking in front of everybody!

18:07.800 --> 18:10.400
It's your fault for leaving me on read.

18:10.400 --> 18:14.320
W-Well, I mean, I...

18:14.810 --> 18:18.280
Anyway, let's get the work 
out of the way first.

18:21.080 --> 18:23.040
That goes in black.

18:28.630 --> 18:30.210
Hey, Maehara.

18:30.950 --> 18:31.840
What?

18:33.270 --> 18:34.640
Aren't you gonna ask?

18:35.170 --> 18:35.930
About what?

18:36.450 --> 18:40.140
Why I've been avoiding you, 
and all that other stuff.

18:40.140 --> 18:41.720
Do you wanna talk about it?

18:41.720 --> 18:43.920
I don't...

18:44.690 --> 18:49.150
but I know this can't go on forever.

18:49.430 --> 18:51.860
The thing with Yuu, too.

18:51.860 --> 18:57.680
Frankly, I do wanna ask, and I do 
wanna know what you're thinking.

18:58.600 --> 19:01.100
But I'm not going to force it out of you.

19:01.540 --> 19:05.870
Are you sure? I might not ever tell you.

19:05.870 --> 19:09.860
That's fine, too. 
I'll wait until you're ready.

19:14.100 --> 19:15.910
Maehara, you dumbass.

19:15.910 --> 19:17.530
Wait, what?

19:17.940 --> 19:20.200
You stupid idiot!

19:20.980 --> 19:26.310
I like how nice you are, but when you 
take that too far, you're just a softie!

19:26.310 --> 19:30.270
And some nasty person might 
take advantage of you someday.

19:30.640 --> 19:34.030
A nasty coward like me, for example.

19:34.440 --> 19:35.540
U-Uh...

19:35.540 --> 19:38.740
Don't! You're not allowed to turn around!

19:40.750 --> 19:42.560
Say, Maehara.

19:42.890 --> 19:48.250
If I said I wanted to fess up, 
would you hear me out?

19:48.250 --> 19:49.620
I would.

19:49.620 --> 19:54.400
Also, could I ask you to wait 
until after the school festival?

19:54.850 --> 19:56.720
It's up to you.

19:58.030 --> 19:59.350
Thanks.

20:00.770 --> 20:04.390
I'll hash it out with Yuu, too. 
So just give me some time.

20:06.210 --> 20:06.950
Sure.

20:07.480 --> 20:09.440
JOUTOU HIGH SCHOOL FESTIVAL

20:09.440 --> 20:12.110
JOUTOU HIGH SCHOOL FESTIVAL

20:15.110 --> 20:17.900
JOUTOU HIGH SCHOOL FESTIVAL

20:29.080 --> 20:30.370
Yeah!

20:33.850 --> 20:36.630
Even I could pull it off, huh?

20:37.050 --> 20:37.990
Yeah.

20:40.630 --> 20:44.640
Asanagi, can I ask you for something?

20:45.790 --> 20:49.140
If you don't want to, that's fine.

20:49.710 --> 20:52.150
But can we hold hands?

20:53.230 --> 20:57.990
Oh, it's just... 
It seemed like you were cold.

20:58.390 --> 21:02.950
Are you trying to lift my spirits?

21:03.470 --> 21:05.130
You? Looking out for me?

21:07.090 --> 21:09.140
Your hand's so warm.

21:09.140 --> 21:10.620
Gee, thanks.

21:10.920 --> 21:14.090
Thanks. That helped me relax some.

21:16.570 --> 21:17.920
You're late, Yuu.

21:17.920 --> 21:21.800
Sorry, Umi. I got too into 
talking to some friends.

21:23.430 --> 21:24.760
Hey!

21:25.040 --> 21:27.600
Over here, you two!

21:28.210 --> 21:31.380
Oh, we need to introduce them to Maki-kun.

21:31.380 --> 21:34.480
Umi and I have been friends 
with them since elementary school.

21:34.480 --> 21:35.940
Wrong, Yuu.

21:36.890 --> 21:38.820
That may be true for you,

21:39.130 --> 21:41.160
but it's not for me.

21:41.820 --> 21:49.000
After all, you two don't really 
see me as a friend, do you?

21:50.700 --> 21:52.080
Asanagi...

21:52.080 --> 21:55.440
This is sooner than I planned,

21:55.440 --> 21:58.800
but hear me out, Maehara and Yuu.

21:59.920 --> 22:05.180
Let me tell you about my petty 
little inferiority complex.

22:07.140 --> 22:10.810
Translation: Sriram Gurunathan

